  "content": "<h4><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/LhdB1n9h/icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"713\" height=\"713\"></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>📘：總覽</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Good Ending 是一款旨在通過添加新內容（如新生物羣系、機制、生物等）來改善荒野環境的模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>🔧：<strong>團隊成員</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- Orcinus：</strong><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/OrcinusWasTaken\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Twitter]</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.gg/HSyVPZTFvF\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Discord 伺服器]</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>- Ninni：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Ninnih_\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Twitter]</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Py4EM8rBRp\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Discord 伺服器]</a>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>📝：備註</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組支援 Forge 和 Fabric。</span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4>🧰：<strong>整合包設計者</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以將此模組放入您的整合包中，但請務必為我們署名！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏅</span>：<strong>致謝</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fminecraftsuggestions%252fcomments%252fwrr73m%252fthe_wild_update_good_ending_exploring_the_lost%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.reddit.com/r/minecraftsuggestions/comments/wrr73m/the_wild_update_good_ending_exploring_the_lost/</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px是的，我們已獲得該創作者許可，可以使用其想法來開發此模組。</span></p>",
